Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.37,0:00:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.41,0:00:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,您给恺撒派了任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have given Caesar mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他秘密潜入了叛贼阵营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He secrets himself among the rebels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉你的敌人就是我最大的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Greater glory than the death of your enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.23,0:00:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我命令他们坚守阵地 但他们逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ordered them to stand ground but they fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,您想让我受到怎样的惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What punishment would you have me inflict?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,十一抽杀律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Decimation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,五十个人 五十颗石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fifty men, fifty stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,五颗抹上了死亡的颜色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Five stained with the promise of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,完成了我这最后一个要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See this last thing that I ask of you to its end,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证将城里所有的财物都装上你的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I will fill your ship with all the riches this city yet holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那就成交了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see it done then brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 克雷斯他们都疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus, Crixus and the others have gone mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,拿好武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get your weapons,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看好西利西亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}keep watch over the Cilicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你很喜欢跟他们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You seem you favor their fucking company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.93,0:00:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我恢复理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will regain sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,失去理智的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is you who has lost sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但如今我怀疑他走错了路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I now doubt path he travels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then perhaps the time has come,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,走我们自己的路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to forge our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,《歃血手足》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,清理掉他们的血 撒上盐 做好防腐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See them cleaned of blood and salted, to hold rot at length.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也许还有用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They maybe yet some purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我想耽搁你一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would share a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我没空 也不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no time nor desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也许卡斯特斯有空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps Castus is less taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢他看你的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not care for the way his eyes frame upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在巴蒂塔斯家当奴隶时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A gaze I grew familiar with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是这样看我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when we were yet slaves to Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.73,0:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怕是要旧事重演了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear return to days of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,经过屠杀罗马俘虏那件事之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are many who believe Crixus holds higher ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人都向着克雷斯那边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the slaughtering of the prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来 你向着哪边呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And where do you stand, in such regard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我支持你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在战场上 我永远支持你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And always shall upon field of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.07,0:04:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,回宅子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Return to the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在的时候 你必须守着莱塔他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you guard Laeta and her people in my absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让这么多蠢蠢欲动的家伙留在城里行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it wise leaving city walls with so much unsettled within them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是该跟他谈谈 弥补一下裂痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should you not attempt words and the healing of festering wound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好谈的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm done with words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你该学学我们的语言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, you must learn our tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就知道她是怎么骂你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you would know what curses she rains upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,操你妈的你这个杂种
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒觉得无知是福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I prefer the bliss of ignorance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,说得真对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As all men should, huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去西西里岛 还有一场恶战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We break for Sicilia, and the promise of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是喝酒的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is ill time for drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是来帮帮卢戈兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but lend support to brother Lugo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.71,0:05:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还有水里的妖怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the monsters within it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯大王 一切准备就绪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All has been prepared for your voyage, King Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我遵守了约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As agreed upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候还有数不清的报酬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With many times its weight to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,足够用来买酒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More than enough for wine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,夜夜春宵都没有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and for soft lips around you cock huh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别对那个叙利亚男孩依依不舍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to remove lingering thoughts of the Syrian boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不跟我们走吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not sail with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥还有很多事情要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heracleo is for more pressing matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我花钱让你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I paid for your services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你雇的是我的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You paid for my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那谁来驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who shall helm it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我出钱雇了特来冯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is what I pay Tryphon for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一路顺风 斯巴达克斯大王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good fortune, King Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝酒的时候会敬你一杯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall raise a cup in your honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永远不会忘记今夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let this night be forever remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想打架吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wish to fight now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:07:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,面对斯巴达克斯的时候你怎么没这么勇猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where was such lust for blood when stood against Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们陷入了如此境地都是因为你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are mired in piss and shit because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们从敌人面前逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because you turned and fled like frightened children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,吓得屁滚尿流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the face of our enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还活着简直是天理不容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is cruelest fate that you yet draw breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,而随我英勇战斗的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}While the man who stood ground beside me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.41,0:07:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们的懦弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was struck from this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,却永远离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your fucking cowardice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让路 - 让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Clear way! - Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的粮草要达到应有的标准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have our stores fall below reasonable note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:08:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,从西西里岛的粮仓再运点过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See more grain brought from holdings in Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,梅泰勒斯元老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senator Metellus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉未曾远迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies for lack of proper reception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想到你会从舒适的祖国罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was unaware you'd strayed so far{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,千里迢迢地跑过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from the comforts of mother Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没想要虚荣的礼节 奢华的接待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I seek neither vain formality nor luxurious appointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想问你一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only answer to singular question,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么元老院给了你一支军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why did the Senate granted you an army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你却在距敌半日路程的地方按兵不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only for it to stand idle half day's march from Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,元老院没有给我军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Senate did not grant me an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是让我指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They granted command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,每匹马 每把剑 你目所能及的每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every horse, every sword, every man your eye lays upon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我自己出钱买来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was purchased with coin from my own vaults.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.73,0:08:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只遵从马科斯•克拉苏一人的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall be set to purpose by the will of Marcus Crassus alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,据说与斯巴达克斯首次对战就撤退了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it your will that sounded retreat against{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是你的意志吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus in inaugural confrontation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你的任务是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were dispatched to balm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,挽回我们之前的败局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}grievous wound suffered against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是再用坏消息给我们的伤口撒盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not to inflict further injury with such unfortunate news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一场不该发动的小打小闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A minor skirmish foolishly engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经处理过那些不守军纪的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those who turned from their duty have been dealt with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事简直是荒谬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}News that also inflames ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的恢复了臭名昭著的十一抽杀律吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it true you exhume putrid spectre of decimation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是用必要的惩戒 教他们什么叫责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but give needed lesson in commitment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,当我的士兵再次面对斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When next my soldiers face Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就轮到那些叛贼遭受不幸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it shall be the rebel who falls to misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,民众当然乐意听到胜利的喜讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The people shall greet such event with celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,正如伊伯利亚人庆祝庞培的胜利一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As they greet word of Pompey's victory in Hispania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他打败了塞多留叛军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has defeated Sertorius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他马上要带领军团再次迎接我们的欢呼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And soon shall be once again upon our shores with his own legions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,届时斯巴达克斯仍在作乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It shall be of a comfort...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对他来说可是好事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if Spartacus yet plagues us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不等那位年轻的屠夫回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus shall be far from thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的问题就能解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in advance of the adolescent butcher's return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你口气倒是很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your tongue rattles bold noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,却只是坐在这里无动于衷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But here you sit absent thunder and purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,朝着他们的城墙乱冲乱撞不成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hurtle myself against city walls in mad attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你解决这件事 统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you bring this to an end, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing already set to motion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒去了希留爱沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar is within Sinnuessa,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,混入了叛贼当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}secreted among the rebels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我们的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would place our fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,交给了那个狂妄的小子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the hands of that arrogant fucking boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,靠蛮力是征服不了斯巴达克斯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus will not be put to grass by brute force,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,庞培肯定只会蛮干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as Pompey would surely attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a man of keen intellect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,对付他只能靠智取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and must be dealt with in kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像很敬佩他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak as though you admire the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他出身寒微\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He came from humble beginnings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,现在连元老院都被他吓得发抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now even the Senate trembles before him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还有比这更值得敬佩的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I find no greater cause for admiration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,元老院没有发抖…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Senate does not tremble{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你失败了 他们会气得发抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}except in anger that you fail to act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在等待合适的时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but wait for proper opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过先对希留爱沙发动一次小小的攻势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet if a small force advanced upon above Sinuessa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也能鼓舞士气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would assuage fears...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,要多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你带了多少人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many did you travel with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己的人不去 却命令我的人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would seek to order my men to do what you will not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是要跟你分享胜利果实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would seek to include you in glorious victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你不愿意的话 就回去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If thought does not appeal, return home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑作战策略的事情 留给应该考虑的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And leave matters of war to the men who wage them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You give me sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是可以信赖的人 莱西克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've proven yourself trusted, Lyciscus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我决定给你武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would see you well armed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,下次我遇到危险还要靠你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were another attempt made upon my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.95,0:11:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定好好用这把剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I long to see it put to proper use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.33,0:11:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄所愿略同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A desire well shared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,很快我们就会敞开城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon we shall throw open gate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,出去把那些罗马人干死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and split Roman ass with cocks hard of purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.83,0:11:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等他出海回来就跟我们一起打吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will he return from voyage upon sea to join us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯走了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus is no longer among us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.41,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他启程的时候 我 甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was down at the docks when he departed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还有西利西亚人都在码头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with Gannicus and the Cilicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did not know of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他先是保护混账罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He protects the fuckin' Romans,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,现在又一声不吭就跟赫拉克里奥出海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now treads water with Heracleo, absent word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥没跟他一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heracleo does not sail with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他留在希留爱沙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He remains in Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还有卡斯特斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With his man Castus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是来喝酒和泄欲的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are for drink, and baser pleasures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of Agron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯走的时候 他是不是在旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was he stroking Spartacus' cock when ship set to wave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,找到赫拉克里奥 问清楚怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seek Heracleo, and gain knowledge upon subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去跟艾力冈谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will have words with Agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的矛盾又加深了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fucking chasm widens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude, for the food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还有对我们的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the protection you provide my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.91,0:12:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是奉命行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do only as commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但这还是善举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is still a kindness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}much appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她居然感谢我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She fuckin' appreciates us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,换成你们这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and your people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,早就把我们干掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would have us all for the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As we would have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏斯巴达克斯仁慈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But for the mercy of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开 不然就杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give way or see brains upon the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在这里发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn from whatever intentions cloud mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.51,0:13:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不许你碰这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will not lay hands upon these people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对你的罗马宠物一点兴趣也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We give no fuck towards your Roman pets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯为什么走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why has Spartacus left the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪儿听到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did you hear of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give fucking answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等他回来后你自己去问他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seek it from the man himself upon his return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前看高了斯巴达克斯 没想到他只是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought more of Spartacus, than a coward{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.92,0:13:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,玩阴谋诡计的懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of secrets and schemes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你一样吗 偷偷摸摸杀掉这些罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you schemed to slaughter these Romans against his command?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:13:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,跟那些奴役我们的罗马人没两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No different to the ones we suffered beneath as slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,包括夺走你弟弟性命的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or the ones who took your brother's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,原来的你 在面对血海深仇的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There stood a time when you followed your own heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还有几分血性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in matters of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在不是一类人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That we are different men now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不是所有人都如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,跟斯巴达克斯说 等他回来 我有话说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let Spartacus know I will have words, when he returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我虽亲眼目睹了你那么多疯狂的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have born witness to many of your mad plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可还从没想过我们要漂洋过海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never did I believe they would lead us across the seas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,上次出海的时候 我还是披枷带锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Last I found myself upon them, I was in chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,前往罗马的土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bound for Roman soil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妻子也被掳走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My wife taken from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们还不清的血债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing they shall eternally regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点我毫不怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of that I have no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但对于眼下的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet of current intentions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.58,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒没有那么肯定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my mind is of less certainty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,内有克雷斯撒野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus runs wild within the city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,外有克拉苏攻城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus threatens growing storm without.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在去抢西西里岛的粮食 不太合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Time ill considered for assault towards wheat in Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥说有大批粮草运到那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heracelo tells of shipments large in the gathering,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是给马科斯•克拉苏准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}tended for Marcus Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是宁肯对付他这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would sever a blow to the man himself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是他的钱包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not his purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,粮草是他军队的给养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The food is meant to feed his army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,抢来粮草 就能削弱敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seizing it will aid in weak them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那样克拉苏才能按我们的套路出牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and force Crassus to fall to desired path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Point well made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不用我说你也应该能想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One perhaps you would divine absent my words,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你别老泡在酒坛子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were head not forever steeped in wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,人在世上走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man must do what he can to brace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要及时行乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}against the shit of a simple day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你有很高的期望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hold you towards loftier esteem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我死了 那些忠于大业的人也会如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As would most loyal to our cause... if I were to fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我在这件事上的态度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know my thoughts towards the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是领袖的料子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am no leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你证明了你比克雷斯更有资格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You proved yourself more one than Crixus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在他动手杀人的那天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when streets flowed with unfortunate blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要是妮维雅没把我放倒在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had Naevia not put me to ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能也会做出同样的举动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I may have spilt the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would not have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,到岸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They come to land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等不及要杀罗马人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And blood of fucking Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有一天你能找到更接近你内心的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps one day you will find reason closer to heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,担当应有的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to assume deserved mantle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能我今晚就会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And perhaps I will fall this very night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让你跟那些女人一起哭鼻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and leave you to weep with the other women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,保持队形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep formation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wish to leave us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我赛纳斯送你上路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sanus will send you on your way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.45,0:18:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏对我们可真是慷慨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus well provides us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没有逃跑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,都死光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看看他今晚还为我们提供什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see what more he has to offer this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到他的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I look into his eyes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,发现他已不是那个我认识的孩子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and no longer gaze upon the boy I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他的目光里有一种冷漠的疏离感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have witnessed cold distance in his stare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,您应该跟他谈谈 让他回到父亲身边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should break words and draw him near, where he belongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我又何尝不希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing do I crave more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他必须找到他自己的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet he has to find his own path,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不然便会永远迷失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or be forever lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.89,0:19:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有深思熟虑就说出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I speak my heart, absent thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看到所爱的人漂泊无依 实在不好受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It weighs heavy, seeing one so loved cast adrift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能点亮灯塔 指引他回来的航程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can offer him no light upon welcoming shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但你或许可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you may appear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,成为他的北极星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as bright as the North Star,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,永远为他指路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}constant in its guidance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能平复父子俩的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd do anything to ease the suffering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意献出一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of both son, and noble father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.84,0:19:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,当我拥你入怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you are within my arms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事情都不重要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the world falls from concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远陪在您身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will forever find me there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,直到诸神从天上摔下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until the gods tumble from the heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,总算掷了一次好点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At last the fucking dice from favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把你从我这儿偷的钱赢回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall see balance of what you have stolen returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我可要把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall see balance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.35,0:21:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一肚子的酒都尿出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of wine drained from cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.58,0:21:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天色还早 女人也嫩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The night is young and so are the whores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,留下来吧 等夜深了女人玩够了再回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Linger, see both properly aged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那好 再来一局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Another game, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我赢得这么容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came about winnings easily,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,输的时候可舍不得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would part with them hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.61,0:21:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿你跟斯巴达克斯做交易也能大赚一笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that all profited so in dealings with Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,等西西里岛传来消息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear blood soon to replace desired coin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就怕没钱可赚 到头来只有死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when news meets of the rebel king's madness in Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿确实让人担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a thing to trouble thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯指挥你的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Spartacus commanding your ship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,跑去捞钱了 却要你们留在岸上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}forcing you to shore as he sails towards uncertain fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他那是脑子一热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A decision made of own fucking mind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.47,0:21:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,却没有考虑清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}absent cracks threatening foundation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,敢去动全共和国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To set upon holdings of the richest man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:21:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,最富有的人的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in all the Republic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is invitation for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,自己找死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}calamity and collapse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯到西西里岛打克拉苏去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus moves against Crassus on Sicilia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.67,0:22:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是去醒醒酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would clear head and cock,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,免得这张嘴不听使唤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before more piss flows from errant tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.87,0:22:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move my darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.95,0:22:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我想克雷斯会很想听到这个消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think Crixus would be eager to learn this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.29,0:22:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,先等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.57,0:22:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看从西利西亚人那里还能不能套出什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see what more can be drawn from Cilician waters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was of similar mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.67,0:22:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你得吃点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那人很不乐意看到我们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man resents we yet draw breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.21,0:23:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他的怒气不是朝着你们来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not stand object of his displeasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.64,0:23:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈 稍等片刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron. Pause a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.31,0:23:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯快到岸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus is due upon docks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.47,0:23:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去接他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would greet his return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.47,0:23:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我有话想跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would have much needed words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有什么话要说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I yet have none to break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.52,0:23:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,莱茵河东岸的人是不是经常临阵脱逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it a common trait among men east of the Rhine to run from a fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.33,0:23:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可我知道了有一个叙利亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I have learned it one of a Syrian to shit lies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.33,0:23:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,满口谎言 还好意思说是甜言蜜语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from mouth and deem them sweetest nectar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.86,0:23:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有做出有负于你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have not broken trust with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟卡斯特斯在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were with Castus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时命令过你不要跟他在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After I commanded you remain absent his company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.49,0:23:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,命令我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Commanded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.32,0:23:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我脖子上的项圈早就不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The collar that once bound my neck is but distant memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.29,0:23:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别以为我会为了你重新戴起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not think I will slip it 'round again for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不要失态了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not raise fucking hackle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.19,0:23:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我在对你做出保证后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I had been discovered with the Cilician{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.55,0:23:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还跟西利西亚人在一起 你也会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after promises made to you, you would be of equal passion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.06,0:23:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯他们发疯的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came upon Castus in the street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.47,0:23:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我在街上撞见了卡斯特斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while Crixus and the others were seized with madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.31,0:23:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去找你和斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We broke for you and Spartacus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.65,0:23:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,连说话的工夫都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}absent time even for words to pass between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我相信 城那么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I am to believe of all within the city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.58,0:23:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,偏偏他正好出现在你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he miraculously appears by your side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.83,0:23:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,换我也会信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I would believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.08,0:24:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不管什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In all things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.75,0:24:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron, we have a fuckin' problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.86,0:24:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,山上有多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many crest hill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.38,0:24:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大约三十个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thirty by count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.55,0:24:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,晨雾里可能藏着更多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps more concealed by dawn's mist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.86,0:24:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,斥候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Scouts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这么少的人不可能进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their numbers stand too few for advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.41,0:24:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,敌军很快就会增多 军团随即杀到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon they shall swell, their legions crashing upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们要让他们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then perhaps we should send message{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.57,0:24:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,想打败我们那是做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the folly of such an attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.25,0:24:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起兵器 准备开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gather weapons, and prepare to open gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.77,0:24:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯不允许贸然与克拉苏交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus would not allow foolish attack on Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.29,0:24:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他自己倒去攻打西西里岛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whilst he lays assault on the man in Sicilia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.78,0:24:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他去攻打克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He moves towards Crassus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.26,0:24:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们却只能坐在这儿傻等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and yet we're to sit here stoking cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.04,0:24:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要让克拉苏知道 全世界的财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us show Crassus that all the coin in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也不能阻止他血流满地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will not stay his blood upon fucking ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能发号施令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not lead these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.06,0:25:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候我该挺身而出了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it's time I should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.97,0:25:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你大呼小叫做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you assembled with rising intent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.63,0:25:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,去会会山上那些罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To meet those of Rome, gathered upon hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.86,0:25:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他下令打开城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's given order to throw open gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.13,0:25:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要打开城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see it opened as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.10,0:25:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他终于开窍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At last he falls to fucking reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.07,0:25:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你误会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well you mistake me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.92,0:25:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是要克拉苏的军队打进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not give command to see Crassus' men engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.03,0:25:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then what moves purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.69,0:25:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是要释放城内的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see what remains of our Roman guests released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.62,0:25:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你要放他们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You set them free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈脑子进水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have lost fucking mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.59,0:25:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一切重要决策 你都无权过问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you have lost voice in all decisions of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.63,0:26:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不等我的命令就擅自开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attempt to raise gate in advance of my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.57,0:26:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那就永远别想再回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you will find it forever shut behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.13,0:26:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲的宅邸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems another life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.86,0:26:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是多么暖和多么舒服 真像上辈子的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when we were embraced by the warmth of your father's villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么觉得一样冷呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For some a place of each chill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.11,0:26:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你多久没吃东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When last did food pass lips?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.62,0:26:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我懒得去想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing of no care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.31,0:26:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说却是最重要的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To me nothing stands more so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.96,0:26:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,到我的帐篷休息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us fall to the comfort of my tent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别在外面挨饿受冻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and turn from unforgiving ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.87,0:27:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟手下在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remain with my men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.37,0:27:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅是这样下令的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As the Imperator would have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.46,0:27:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲对你的关心超过你的想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father cares for you more than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.03,0:27:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他是通过我来关心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His hand offered through touch of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.53,0:27:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是他让你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You come to me upon his order?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.40,0:27:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他作出了表态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has chosen to make gesture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.42,0:27:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就看你选择接不接受了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just as you must choose how it is received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.94,0:27:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那些攻击我们的人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of your men that set upon us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.69,0:27:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们愿意放我们生路吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They now stand willing to see us live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们失去了理智 不再是我的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are no longer my men, nor stand for reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.72,0:27:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你们出城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see you from the city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.76,0:28:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,摆脱他们的怒火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and far from their wrath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.81,0:28:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你这么大发慈悲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you have come to such compassion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不在他们动手前送走我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in advance of unfortunate events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.62,0:28:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的行为伤害了你们 也伤害了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've both been deeply wounded by them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.59,0:28:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你受到的伤害根本不值一提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have suffered but annoying scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.64,0:28:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不要拿来跟我们的残肢断臂相提并论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not seek to place it upon level with severed fucking limb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.08,0:28:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想怎么分道扬镳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I seek nothing, except the parting of ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.98,0:28:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,摆脱你们 摆脱那些不听我指挥的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From you, and those who would break from my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.46,0:28:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你要逼克雷斯他们离开希留爱沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You forced Crixus and the other from Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.30,0:28:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们留在城里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'd remain within cursed walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.84,0:28:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我要带上忠于我的队伍去西西里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am for Sicilia with those yet loyal and points beyond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.14,0:28:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,强大的斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mighty Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.58,0:28:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃了宏图伟业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turning from noble cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.40,0:28:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是另选一条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but choose another path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.80,0:28:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一条边走边杀人的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One slick with blood, as any you travel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.79,0:28:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是罗马逼我这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One Rome set me upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.89,0:28:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了 你要谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be thankful I leave its shores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.51,0:28:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,向你的神祈祷我再也别回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And pray to your gods I never return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.62,0:28:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.54,0:29:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快点退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move! Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.54,0:29:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天我们会要了你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall have your blood upon a day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.05,0:29:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你能苟活 都因为斯巴达克斯犯傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are blessed because Spartacus stands a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.27,0:29:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.13,0:30:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你害我们陷入危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You put us all at risk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.28,0:30:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是往胜利迈进了一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but move more to victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.47,0:30:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,放了敌人还能获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By setting our enemies to the winds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.14,0:30:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你要发泄怒火找错了人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You place wrath upon errant hem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.48,0:30:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏才是真正的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus stands truer enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.29,0:30:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而你把武器送到人家手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you deliver weapon into waiting hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.89,0:30:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,莱塔那些人在我们这里太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Laeta and the others have been among us too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.41,0:30:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很可能听到了什么 看到了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What they might have heard or laid eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.91,0:30:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们看见了兄弟决裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They laid eyes on two brothers divided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.59,0:30:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须重归于好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A chasm we must bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.51,0:30:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧 你还瞒着我们去西西里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One widen by your schemes in Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.95,0:30:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏也会和你一样相信这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing Crassus will believe as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.20,0:30:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,莱塔肯定会亲口告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When Laeta tells him of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.97,0:30:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你放了她 是为了让克拉苏知道你的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You release her, so he will know of your plans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当他出兵阻止我的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when he moves to halt them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.59,0:30:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就彻底消灭克拉苏和他的罗马军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall see the man and his legions to their end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.83,0:30:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥的船载我们一半人去西西里岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heracleo and his ships will carry half our forces in waves to Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.02,0:30:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,赛纳斯带一批可信的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sanus and a clutch of trusted men to ensure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.69,0:30:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,确保西利西亚人履行承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Cilicians stay true to bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.27,0:30:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我就留在城里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I to remain in the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.81,0:30:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那些忠于你的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With those known to be loyal to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.29,0:30:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,至少克拉苏是这样认为的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least that is what Crassus will believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.38,0:30:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,给盐渍过的罗马人尸体乔装打扮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Roman bodies we have salted will be clothed to our cause,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.71,0:31:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们造成人数未减的假象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and placed to give the illusion of presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.04,0:31:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你带人从北门出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall lead your forces through northern gate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.15,0:31:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过米利亚峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and across Melia Ridge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.63,0:31:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,同时我们袭击克拉苏在岛上的粮仓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while we set upon Crassus' grain holdings on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.69,0:31:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他就只能兵分两路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will have no choice but to break men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.02,0:31:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,以保护粮草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in order to protect his supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.06,0:31:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,分散他的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dividing his legions...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.63,0:31:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们便有时间到山上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Giving you time to crest the ridge...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.46,0:31:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等他们认为你们还在城内时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and drop upon his remaining forces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.86,0:31:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你就对克拉苏的残军发起攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while they yet believe you within city walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.94,0:31:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我人不够 打不过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will be too few to defeat him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.03,0:31:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你可能是不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alone, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.54,0:31:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会让你孤军作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I would not have you so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.12,0:31:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们悄悄撤离西西里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall slip from Sicilia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让克拉苏的军队登陆后扑个空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after Crassus' men have landed to engage us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.77,0:31:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们从海上支援你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And from the sea we shall join our brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.25,0:31:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对克拉苏的残军形成腹背夹击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Setting upon Crassus' weakened forces from two sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.06,0:31:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,当时你就知道这个计划吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You knew of this, when we broke words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.03,0:31:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,只有艾力冈帮我保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I held only Agron to confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.97,0:31:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯在返回来的路上才知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus being brought to knowledge during return from sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.09,0:31:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能冒险让莱塔他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not risk Laeta and the others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.12,0:31:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我们真正的意图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}discovering true intention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.06,0:31:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一帮混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fucking shits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.19,0:31:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近火气那么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have been disagreeable of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.42,0:31:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,难保你跟你女人破坏了这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any wonder you and your woman were left from fold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.53,0:32:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能再纠结于过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must move past it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.94,0:32:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,否则全都完蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or fall to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.26,0:32:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,迪欧特莫斯说过 这个季节不能上山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Diotimus told of the ridge being impassable this late in season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.43,0:32:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人也是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing the Romans will believe as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.82,0:32:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你要证明他们想错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall prove them in gravest error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就想给他们教训了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A lesson I long to teach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.18,0:32:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人上岸时要隐秘行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See our people quietly upon land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.02,0:32:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,再神鬼莫测地杀个回马枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and make swift return for more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.24,0:32:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你不在时 我尽量少杀几个罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall try not to kill to many Romans short of your presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.87,0:32:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃喝玩乐爽够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've had your fill of women and drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.03,0:32:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我在海上讨生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a man of the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.87,0:32:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,离开了海就不自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And do not belong from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.43,0:32:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候卡斯特斯酒醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Castus ever awakes form drink,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.61,0:32:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,带个话 我们来接他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}give word and we shall return for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.62,0:32:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude, for all you have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.24,0:32:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.07,0:32:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是为赚钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am but for coin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.26,0:32:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要有足够的分量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the weight of it in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.70,0:32:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来就有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall have it upon return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.50,0:32:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,荣耀的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A glorious day for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.44,0:32:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until such time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.89,0:32:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯大王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.26,0:33:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这计划真他妈疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a mad fucking plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.01,0:33:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对我的胃口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sort I most favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.95,0:33:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,从北方传来的消息准确吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You deem report from northern efforts accurate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.34,0:33:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.63,0:33:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们便静待时机吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we but await divinity of the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.51,0:33:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要等的是诸神的预兆…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If sign from the gods is all you seek to spur intent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.02,0:33:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那就看看这个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then lay wanting eyes upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.26,0:33:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯从希留爱沙山释放了一些俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus releases a clutch of prisoners from Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.74,0:33:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定对她带来的消息感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will find what this one carries upon tongue of pressing interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.85,0:33:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well come. Break silence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.98,0:33:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让我掂量掂量你带来的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see more discerning mind gauge worth of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.46,0:33:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯他们往西西里去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus and his men move against Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.99,0:33:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the remainder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们和斯巴达克斯决裂了 还留在城里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have fractured from the man and yet hold the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.04,0:33:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now is our chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.58,0:33:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,守卫希留爱沙的叛贼少了一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sinuessa stands but partially defended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.36,0:33:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it would appear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.21,0:33:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睁睁看着家乡沦陷 肯定不好受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must brought great suffering, to witness the fall of your city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.32,0:33:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,难以形容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beyond the telling of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.85,0:34:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可你没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet you survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.57,0:34:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,实在太走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A most fortunate blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.18,0:34:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只因我是市政官的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bestowed only by name of Aedile's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.23,0:34:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你是恩尼乌斯的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand married to Ennius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.44,0:34:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你问这些做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not see the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.34,0:34:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.71,0:34:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他死之前 是我的夫君\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When he was yet of this world, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.86,0:34:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯知道我的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus knew of this, and forced me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.35,0:34:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,逼迫我帮忙与西利西亚人做交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to lend aid in dealing with the Cilicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.11,0:34:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮助那个杀死你丈夫的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You gave aid to the man that robbed you of husband's life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.49,0:34:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就为了自保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in order to save your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.79,0:34:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为了保护城内还活着的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To save as many of my people that yet drew breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.23,0:34:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就算重来一次 我还是会这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing I would do again, if so needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.00,0:34:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.98,0:34:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这个女人提供了重要情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The woman gives vital information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.10,0:34:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么还是按兵不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you continue to stand idle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.92,0:34:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 我在等待时机 如今机会来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I have said, I but pause for opportunity, now presented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.57,0:34:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude for your spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.10,0:34:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们夺回你的城市 我们再聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall break words again, once we retake your city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.30,0:34:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,传令下去 准备出兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give command to prepare for march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.11,0:34:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你这儿有酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have wine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.67,0:34:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,白葡萄酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Falernian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.68,0:35:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲赐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A gift from your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.41,0:35:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,来 喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, let us share a cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.22,0:35:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,部队正在集结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The legions have been called to formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.92,0:35:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿是好兆头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray it a favored sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.63,0:35:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,希望战争赶快结束 我们就能回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the war will soon be over, and we may return home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.40,0:35:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们便能荣耀加身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be met with glory and laurels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.05,0:35:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,加在统帅和那些尚在军中的人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the Imperator and the men that yet serve beneath him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.87,0:35:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在能轻松对敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To move without cherished son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.91,0:35:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心爱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}weighs upon his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.48,0:35:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我没说我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not speak of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.11,0:35:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是在残酷的命令下丧命的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But of those robbed of life by intemperate command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.89,0:35:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道他下令也不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that it was not given lightly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.36,0:35:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也并非毫无悔意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor absent regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.65,0:35:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望是我抽到这颗石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that I had drawn this stone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.84,0:35:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,代替萨比努斯死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and had fallen in Sabinus' place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.91,0:35:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not mean that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.02,0:36:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没了我 这个世界有什么不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would the world not still turn absent my presence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅就不会实现他的野心了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would the Imperator not still march towards desire's end,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.24,0:36:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,摆脱了平庸无能的儿子岂不更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}absent dragging weight of constant disappointment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.89,0:36:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲爱你 提比略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father loves you, Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.82,0:36:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来他更爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It appears he loves you more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.07,0:36:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这说得太离谱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing far removed from truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.43,0:36:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会回归正轨 小少爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything will be as it should, little master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.31,0:36:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会回归正轨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything will be as it should...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.14,0:36:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.57,0:36:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你误会我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mistake intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.73,0:36:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.99,0:36:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是你误会我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mistake mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.58,0:37:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他夺走了我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He took something from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要夺走他的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would have something in return...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.88,0:37:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 提比略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop this... Tiberius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.72,0:37:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了自己的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You forget your place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.88,0:37:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然你现在备受宠爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Despite fine appointments and elevated worth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.70,0:37:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但你还是奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are yet a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,必须服从我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And shall do as I fucking command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.62,0:38:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,把沥青罐子都运下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See all amphoras of pitch from atop wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.15,0:38:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯在山上肯定用得着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus shall find need of them upon the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.33,0:38:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,维提斯克斯 柯瑞斯 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vertiscus! Correus! With me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.40,0:38:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.67,0:38:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.14,0:38:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move. Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.13,0:38:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move along!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.42,0:38:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,利塔威克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Litaviccus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.17,0:38:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把她安全送到营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See her safely towards encampment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.58,0:38:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,能拿的都拿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All we could lay hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.70,0:38:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,城里都空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No more in city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.99,0:38:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望带足了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray we hold enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.23,0:38:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望带足了酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray we hold enough wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.77,0:38:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要开始新的旅程了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We forge journey towards new beginnings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.31,0:39:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我们之间的关系也是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have one between us as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.48,0:39:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.11,0:39:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友 那个铁匠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your friend, the blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.09,0:39:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是他逼我动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Though he forced my hand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.49,0:39:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.02,0:39:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他不该是那样的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he did not deserve such a fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.98,0:39:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我出手也是被逼的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your hand so forced when you made assault upon me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.27,0:39:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不会那么做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you not have done the same,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.90,0:39:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要保护爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to protect one you love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.27,0:39:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在真成了战士 妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a true warrior now, Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.00,0:39:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那么下次无论你以何理由对我出手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lay hand upon me again for whatever reason,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.74,0:39:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定把你当战士对待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I will treat you as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.13,0:39:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.05,0:39:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.31,0:39:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.29,0:39:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.58,0:39:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.47,0:39:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,清空街道 出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clear streets! Move out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.34,0:39:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你走错路了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You move in wrong direction, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.46,0:39:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟克雷斯去米利亚峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are for Crixus and Melia Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.17,0:40:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不愿意走那条绝路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would move towards more promising opportunities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.80,0:40:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈也一样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well as would fucking I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.47,0:40:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不过克雷斯都妥协了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet Crixus has come to terms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.81,0:40:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是凡人 只能随波逐流了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we are but mortal men following in the path of gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.34,0:40:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们最后会冻死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We follow path to frozen death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.19,0:40:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而斯巴达克斯却去了温暖的西西里岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while Spartacus sails towards warm embrace of Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.15,0:40:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会带上你 因为你手上沾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would not have you, so stained with the blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.41,0:40:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他所保护的那些罗马渣滓的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of those Roman shits he gave protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.25,0:40:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The die has been cast,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.78,0:40:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这场戏反正要唱到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we must see game to bitter end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.62,0:40:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suppose we must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.80,0:40:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.38,0:40:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟克雷斯会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us join Crixus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.26,0:40:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 莱西克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you lost your fucking mind, Lyciscus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.96,0:40:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我盖乌斯•尤利乌斯•恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has always been my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.77,0:40:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可是一点也没疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That of Gaius Julius Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.28,0:40:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand Roman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.16,0:41:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you stand for the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.49,0:41:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait! Wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.61,0:41:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你手下留情 我能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}stay your hand and I will offer aid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.99,0:41:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意背叛你的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would turn against your people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.78,0:41:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These- these are not my people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.29,0:41:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我来自莱茵河东岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I come from lands east of the Rhine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.65,0:41:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我还希望有一天能活着回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I would draw breath to return to them upon a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.38,0:41:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以让你接近斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can see you close to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.21,0:41:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,然后一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.28,0:41:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉那个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we can end the mad fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.38,0:41:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我很感激你的提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An offer much appreciated...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.85,0:41:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但我已经有别的计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet I have made other arrangements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.47,0:42:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快过去 街上不留人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move to your purpose and clear the streets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.70,0:42:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,街上不留人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clear the streets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.90,0:42:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,去看看艾力冈和多纳怎么这么慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See what delays Agron and Donar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.01,0:42:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该离开这鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have leave of this fucking city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.62,0:42:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As would I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.69,0:42:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.86,0:42:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你去山上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you for the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.38,0:42:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我去之前有话要跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not wish to leave without words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.95,0:43:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望你不要说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that I could stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.12,0:43:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在你来这儿之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before you came to the city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.89,0:43:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我祈求诸神把我从主人手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I prayed to the gods that they would deliver me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.56,0:43:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,解救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from the hands of my dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.85,0:43:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神回应了我的祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in you my prayers were answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.45,0:43:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前听你说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have heard this tale before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.93,0:43:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但你完全想错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and found it equally misguided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.63,0:43:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不求你相信这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not ask you to believe it true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.41,0:43:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,只希望你知道我是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only to accept that it is what I hold to heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.67,0:43:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.48,0:43:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now on your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.99,0:43:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods watch over you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.14,0:43:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是 如果我不能保佑你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you, if I can not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.64,0:43:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,继续开 抛锚 准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drive on! Secure the ship! Make ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.69,0:43:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们回来晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their return stretches hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.21,0:43:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,西利西亚人从来没有守时的概念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cilicians are not known to be of such concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.24,0:43:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而且没礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor of good manners{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.45,0:43:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也不洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor proper bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.59,0:43:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.02,0:44:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遇到了事 所以耽搁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fates conspired towards unfortunate delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.54,0:44:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,赛纳斯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Sanus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.74,0:44:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gone from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.07,0:44:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人杀了他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He fell to the Romans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.35,0:44:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们欲壑难填 想要很多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To their desires...and to the weight of more coin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.17,0:44:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,国王都给不起的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than even a king could offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.15,0:44:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.49,0:44:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不希望你落到这个下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not wish you such an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.53,0:45:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,全都过来 我们要打开城门 夺回这座城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Over here we must see that the be retaken!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.71,0:45:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,把最后一批沥青送到克雷斯那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gather the last of the pitch and see it to Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.77,0:45:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,完事后到码头见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Meet upon the docks when you are finished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.07,0:45:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.58,0:46:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fucking traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.23,0:46:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是该死的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, a fucking Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.69,0:46:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.33,0:47:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,打开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Open the gates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.00,0:48:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,多纳 绳索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Donar, The Rope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.36,0:49:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.58,0:50:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.83,0:50:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fucking pirates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.12,0:50:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你在最紧要的关头来帮忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You come to aid most fortunate moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.56,0:50:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你一向如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you have often done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.30,0:50:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.23,0:50:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是罗马人的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those are Roman ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.62,0:50:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,撤到山里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back to the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.77,0:51:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.65,0:51:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.44,0:51:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你搞了什么鬼名堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever your plan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.53,0:51:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你死了 一切都结束了 罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it dies with you, Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.82,0:52:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,此时不逃 更待何时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now would be time to run.{\r}
